17) Now, in order to prove the charges against the accused, the prosecution was required to prove the following factors, viz;
(i) A fire broke out in the shop i.e. Paneer Karkhana Shop at 169, Abdul Hakim Wali, Tilak Bazar,
Delhi, and;
(ii) The accused was the owner of the said shop and;
(iii) Fire broke out due to lack of proper measures in the said shop which the accused, as owner of the same, FIR No. 16/2017, PS L. Gate Page No. 10 of 14

Digitally signed by PAYAL PAYAL SINGAL SINGAL Date:
2025.07.12 18:08:18 +0530 State Vs. Sanjay Bansal was bound to maintain to ensure the safety of everyone involved, and;
(iv) The injured/PW-1 suffered grievous injuries resulting from the said fire.
